        {
          "kind": "html",
          "id": "titleblock-div-0",
          "text": "<div class=\"book-title-block\">\n        <h1>APPLETONS' CYCLOPÆDIA OF AMERICAN BIOGRAPHY</h1>\n        <h2>BY MARK TWAIN</h2>\n\n    </div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "id": "prologue-div-1",
          "text": "<div class=\"book-text-content\">\n        <table align=\"center\" width=\"80%\">\n            <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>As it is the commendation of a good huntsman to find game in a wide wood, so it is no imputation\n                        if he hath not caught all. Plato. </td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody>\n        </table>\n        <table align=\"center\">\n            <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                    <td><span><b>Volumes</b></span>\n                        <ul>\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/Appletons%27_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_of_American_Biography/Volume_I._Aaron-Crandall\"\n                                    title=\"Appletons' Cyclopædia of American Biography/Volume I. Aaron-Crandall\">I.\n                                    Aaron–Crandall</a></li>\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/Appletons%27_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_of_American_Biography/Volume_II._Crane-Grimshaw\"\n                                    title=\"Appletons' Cyclopædia of American Biography/Volume II. Crane-Grimshaw\">II.\n                                    Crane–Grimshaw</a></li>\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/Appletons%27_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_of_American_Biography/Volume_III._Grinnell-Lockwood\"\n                                    title=\"Appletons' Cyclopædia of American Biography/Volume III. Grinnell-Lockwood\">III.\n                                    Grinnell–Lockwood</a></li>\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/Appletons%27_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_of_American_Biography/Volume_IV._Lodge-Pickens\"\n                                    title=\"Appletons' Cyclopædia of American Biography/Volume IV. Lodge-Pickens\">IV.\n                                    Lodge–Pickens</a></li>\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/Appletons%27_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_of_American_Biography/Volume_V._Pickering-Sumter\"\n                                    title=\"Appletons' Cyclopædia of American Biography/Volume V. Pickering-Sumter\">V.\n                                    Pickering–Sumter</a></li>\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/Appletons%27_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_of_American_Biography/Volume_VI._Sunderland-Zurita\"\n                                    title=\"Appletons' Cyclopædia of American Biography/Volume VI. Sunderland-Zurita\">VI.\n                                    Sunderland–Zurita</a></li>\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/Appletons%27_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_of_American_Biography/Supplement\"\n                                    title=\"Appletons' Cyclopædia of American Biography/Supplement\">Supplement</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                        <p> <span><b>Lists</b></span> </p>\n                        <ul>\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/Appletons%27_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_of_American_Biography/Fictitious_Entries\"\n                                    title=\"Appletons' Cyclopædia of American Biography/Fictitious Entries\">Fictitious\n                                    Entries</a></li>\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/Appletons%27_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_of_American_Biography/Suspicious_Entries\"\n                                    title=\"Appletons' Cyclopædia of American Biography/Suspicious Entries\">Suspicious\n                                    Entries</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody>\n        </table>\n    </div>"
